# Temporary redirect: the app is served from www.thomaswunsche.com/classodyssey
# while classodyssey.com is still categorised as a Newly Registered Domain by
# the Geneva school proxy (art. 16a LIP) and the school DNS does not resolve
# classodyssey.thomaswunsche.com yet.
classodyssey.com, www.classodyssey.com {
	import security_headers
	redir https://www.thomaswunsche.com/classodyssey{uri} temporary
}
